/T (The catalogue contains a substantial mix of single-ingredient and combination formulations. Out of 243,803 clean records, 134,583 \(55.2%\) are single-ingredient formulations, while 109,220 \(44.8%\) contain a secondary active ingredient. This means combination formulations represent nearly half of the entire catalogue, showing that multi-ingredient products are an important part of the medicine landscape represented in the dataset.)
