/Title (The chart shows that a relatively small group of active ingredients appears across thousands of medicine formulations. Aceclofenac is the most frequently listed ingredient with 6,848 formulations, while Domperidone appears in more than 5,068 formulations across the two strengths shown. Other highly represented ingredients include Cefixime, Diclofenac, Pantoprazole and Telmisartan. Together, these ingredients span four broad areas pain and inflammation, gastrointestinal care, anti-infectives and chronic disease management  showing that the medicine catalogue contains especially high product representation in these therapeutic areas.)
/Dest [19 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 741 0 R
>>
