832 0 obj
<<
/Title (The manufacturer analysis shows that Sun Pharma leads the catalogue with 2,458 formulations, followed by Intas with 2,042 and Cipla with 1,974. However, the top 10 manufacturers together represent only 6.67% of all 243,803 listings, while the top 50 account for 15.35%. This means that the catalogue is not concentrated among a small number of leading companies. Instead, more than 7,500 other manufacturers collectively contribute 84.65% of the listings, revealing a strong long-tail structure in the dataset.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 799 0 R
/First 855 0 R
/Last 855 0 R
/Count -1
>>
endobj
